   "id": 515508,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "The number of permutations of 6 objects taken 2 at a time",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The permutation of <i>n</i> objects taken <i>r</i> at a time is <span data-math=\"{\\rm{nPr}} = \\frac{{n!}}{{(n - r)!}}\"></span>where 1 ≤ <i>r</i> ≤ <i>n</i>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\rm{6P2}} = \\frac{{n!}}{{\\left( {n - r} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{6!}}{{\\left( {6 - 2} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{6!}}{{4!}} = \\frac{{6 \\times 5 \\times 4!}}{{4!}} = 30\"></span></p>\n"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "30"
    }
   ],
