     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The permutation of <i>n</i> objects taken <i>r</i> at a time is <span data-math=\"{\\rm{nPr}} = \\frac{{n!}}{{(n - r)!}}\"></span>where 1 ≤ <i>r</i> ≤ <i>n</i>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\rm{14P4}} = \\frac{{n!}}{{\\left( {n - r} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{14!}}{{\\left( {14 - 4} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{14!}}{{10!}} = \\frac{{14 \\times 13 \\times 12 \\times 11 \\times 10!}}{{10!}} = 24,024\"></span></p>\n"
    }
