     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The permutation of <i>n</i> objects taken <i>r</i> at a time is <span data-math=\"{\\rm{nPr}} = \\frac{{n!}}{{(n - r)!}}\"></span>where 1 ≤ <i>r</i> ≤ <i>n</i>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{\\rm{19P3}} = \\frac{{n!}}{{\\left( {n - r} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{19!}}{{\\left( {19 - 3} \\right)!}} = \\frac{{19!}}{{16!}} = \\frac{{19 \\times 18 \\times 17 \\times 16!}}{{16!}} = 5,814\"></span></p>\n"
    }
